# Utilities slice 2 — a reserve draining and refilling, on the ridge in reservoir.borough.
#
#   godot --path src/Borough.Godot -- --load plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/reservoir.borough \
#     --drive plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/reservoir.drive
#
# The saved city opens on Day 1 with Water fully delivered and two towers filling: a pump in the
# west District, an occupied dwelling and two towers in the east, and one Street crossing the
# boundary between them. Tiles, Building ids and the measured arc are in reservoir.geometry.txt,
# which the fixture writes beside the save.
#
# Two cameras. The wide one holds the whole ridge so the two Districts can be compared. The close
# one stands over the east end, where a selected Building's panel and its massing are in one frame.
#
# ⚠ ONE `shoot` PER TICK, AND THE CAMERA MOVES ON THE TICK IT SHOOTS. `_pendingShot` holds one path
# and the picture is taken on the NEXT frame, so a second `shoot` on the same Tick throws the first
# away and a camera restored after a `shoot` lands in that shot. Hence the gaps.
2049 pause
2049 overlay utilities
2049 ui building 37
2049 ui section utilities on
2049 ui section stocks on
2049 turn left
2049 tilt 40
2049 focus 128 2 560
2049 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/01-day1-filling.png
2049 speed 8

# The reserve stands in Buildings, so one tower holds half of what the District's panel reports.
2051 pause
2051 ui building 38
2051 tilt 45
2051 focus 229 3 90
2051 ui section utilities on
2051 ui section stocks on
2051 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/02-day1-tower.png
2051 speed 8

# Back to the dwelling and the wide eye for the rest of the run.
2053 pause
2053 ui building 37
2053 tilt 40
2053 focus 128 2 560
2053 speed 8

# The settle at Tick 4,096 tops the towers up to their 2,048 and refills only the 64 of room left.
4100 pause
4100 ui section utilities on
4100 ui section stocks on
4100 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/03-day2-full.png
4100 speed 8

# The trigger: the one crossing Street goes, so the pump can reach the east District no longer.
# The Day's delivered fraction was fixed by the settle at Tick 4,096, so the reading does not move
# until the next one.
4102 pause
4102 hold street
4102 click 191 0 shift
4102 ui section utilities on
4102 ui section stocks on
4102 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/04-crossing-removed.png
4102 speed 8

# The settle at Tick 6,144 finds no crossing and covers the whole Day out of the towers. Water is
# still delivered at 100% — which is the whole difference from slice 1, where Power with
# `storage = "none"` went to 0% at this settle.
6150 pause
6150 hold look
6150 ui section utilities on
6150 ui section stocks on
6150 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/05-day3-draining.png
6150 speed 8

# Two Days further down. 576 units a Day leave the towers: 512 of demand and 64 of road loss.
10250 pause
10250 ui section utilities on
10250 ui section stocks on
10250 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/06-day5-low.png
10250 speed 8

# The towers hold 320 against a need of 576, so the Day grades to half rather than failing.
12300 pause
12300 ui section utilities on
12300 ui section stocks on
12300 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/07-day6-half.png
12300 speed 8
12302 pause
12302 tilt 45
12302 focus 225 3 90
12302 ui section utilities on
12302 ui section stocks on
12302 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/08-day6-half-close.png
12302 speed 8

# Empty. The brownout arrives four Days after the road did, and no Rule stops.
14350 pause
14350 tilt 40
14350 focus 128 2 560
14350 ui section utilities on
14350 ui section stocks on
14350 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/09-day7-dark.png
14350 speed 8
14352 pause
14352 ui building 38
14352 tilt 45
14352 focus 229 3 90
14352 ui section utilities on
14352 ui section stocks on
14352 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/10-day7-tower-empty.png
14352 speed 8

# The repair: the same two Nodes joined again.
14354 pause
14354 hold street
14354 click 160 0
14354 click 192 0
14354 speed 8
14356 pause
14356 hold look
14356 ui building 37
14356 tilt 40
14356 focus 128 2 560
14356 ui section utilities on
14356 ui section stocks on
14356 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/11-crossing-relaid.png
14356 speed 8

# The settle at Tick 16,384 finds the link again. Day 8 is whole and the towers are filling.
16400 pause
16400 ui section utilities on
16400 ui section stocks on
16400 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-2/12-day8-restored.png
16400 quit
